  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"失落的飾物重製版橫幅\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fNbAJwj8RHg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Antikythera-Studios/lost-trinkets-renewed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flost-trinkets-renewed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/modrinth.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>失落的飾物重製版（Lost Trinkets Renewed）</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>「失落的飾物」加入了 70 多種極其稀有的可解鎖飾物，擁有各種實用的能力供你遊玩。這些飾物會透過賦予你超強的技能，徹底改變你的遊戲玩法。</em></p>\n<p><strong>如何解鎖飾物：</strong>飾物會在進行各種活動時隨機解鎖，例如與敵人及首領戰鬥、交易、開採礦石、砍伐樹木和農耕。每項活動都有各自的掉落機率，風險較高的活動通常能更快獲得獎勵。（請檢查設定檔以調整不同的解鎖機率至您滿意的程度）</p>\n<p><strong>如何開啟/查看您的飾物：</strong>預設情況下，您可以按下鍵盤上的「R」鍵來開啟飾物介面。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>✨ 特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>豐富的飾物</strong> - 發現、解鎖並嘗試各種飾物，為您的遊戲體驗增添樂趣！</li>\n<li><strong>自訂流派</strong> - 自由搭配並創造不同的流派，徹底改變您的遊戲玩法！</li>\n<li><strong>變得更強大</strong> - 每獲得一個飾物就能變得更強，輕鬆擊敗敵人！</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>📷 媒體</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/Screenshot_20260708_220716.png\" alt=\"媒體截圖\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/1212.png\" alt=\"媒體截圖\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>📥 安裝</h2>\n<p><strong>需要客戶端與伺服器端同步安裝！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Forge/NeoForge 前置需求：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Fabric 前置需求：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>⚙️ 設定</h2>\n<p>大多數選項都可以直接編輯 <code>.minecraft/config/losttrinkets-common.toml</code> 檔案來變更，您可以在該處微調模組以符合您的需求，也可以調整飾物的解鎖機率。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong>對設定檔所做的編輯將在下次載入世界時生效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>❤️ 致謝</h2>\n<p>由 <strong>Antikythera Studios</strong> 精心移植與維護。\n這是 Lost Trinkets 的 1.20+ 版本移植，原版由 owmii 為 Forge 1.16.1-1.16.5 製作。授權為 LGPL，且 owmii 自 2021 年起便失去聯繫，因此我決定接手此模組。現已支援 1.20+ 的 Forge/NeoForge 與 Fabric。</p>\n<p>喜歡這個模組嗎？在 GitHub 倉庫上給個 ⭐，或在 Modrinth / CurseForge 上推薦本模組，都能提供莫大的幫助。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2724\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/support.png\" alt=\"贊助與合作夥伴\"></a></p>",
